	"_doc": "The cast, in the order the adopt screen lists them. Adding an animal = add an entry here + its gift table in gifts.json. 'table' is which gift table it brings gifts from (all the dogs share 'dog', both cats share 'cat'). 'home' is the place it lives: the place picker starts there for a new pet. 'unlock' is what it takes to adopt one (leave it out, or {}, for from the start): {\"level\": 3} reach level 3; {\"hours\": 20} focus 20 hours in all; {\"hours\": 10, \"place\": \"jungle\"} focus 10 hours in the Jungle; {\"table\": \"cat\"} find every gift in the cat table; {\"all_tables\": true} find every gift there is. 'shape' picks the placeholder drawing until real art exists; 'sprite_dir' is the folder of its art (see art/README.md): an animal.tscn there replaces the placeholder. Colours are defaults for each recolourable part, in order (shown as primary, secondary and tertiary when adopting). 'sound' is a file in assets/sounds/ (without .mp3); it stays quiet until that file exists. 'dive' is how it jumps into the bushes to fetch a gift: 'hops' arcs of 'height' pixels over 'seconds' (0 hops = it walks or slides in).",
